ucting structured graph representations of visual elements (such as bar plots) and tabular data, enabling precise alignment between visual and textual information. However, in documented failure cases, RAG-Anything produced an incorrect answer regarding the NER label generation sequence and failed to correctly interpret an irregular table in a cross-modal noise scenario. The framework's documentation also addresses challenges and future directions for multimodal RAG."}
